Package: foldbenchR
Title: Crease-Pattern Manifolds as Ground Truth for Dimension Reduction
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@charite.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Generates finite Miura sheets using a closed-form rigid folding
    map and samples their surfaces with known flat material coordinates.
    Provides dimension-reduction benchmarks, product and orthonormal lift
    constructions, and reconstruction and neighbourhood metrics. Includes a
    flat Yoshimura pattern for geometric inspection; its folding kinematics
    and waterbomb mechanisms are not implemented.
